                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.00/1765.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Consul at
                            Foochow to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Foochow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-07-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 20, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Province of Fukien declared its independence on this date.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fowler</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
